/stix "A cinematic stick figure animation about discipline. A tired stickman lying in a dark bedroom hits the snooze button. He keeps saying tomorrow and looks weak. Calendar pages fly away as he sits alone looking empty. Suddenly he sits up with strong determination. Then a montage of him running in the rain, training hard, and working late at night. Finally he stands tall at sunrise looking strong and calm, and walks into bright light with the text Day one or one day. Serious emotional mood, dark to hopeful style."
